    operand <name><sep><value> of this seed's seed_launch / scope_env / managed env contracts, read through the declared
    path word (bootstrap-relative; genesis.launch.env_pair_separator, the ONE env-pair home), never a literal. Shell
    assignments, the -e name_eq_value word and git.write.env_assign are distinct contracts and do not read it. -#}
