    texts / text_codes :4495-4518, ssh_auth.seed_check :4748-4766): ONE declared diagnostic text as ONE shell word.
    node carries texts and diagnostics.fields; each {placeholder} must be a diagnostics.fields entry and is filled from
    words (a declared word at render time, shq) or shell (the seed's own observed shell value, double-quoted); every
    other byte is the declared text (shq), so no wording is added. An undeclared text, an undeclared placeholder or a
    placeholder without a source is a render error (no fallback). -#}
{%- macro diag_text(node, key, words, shell) -%}
