    work_roots.run_local / run_local.caller_vars; census records-c1-invocation-context-01 sr922g_c1 6133d657): ONE
    declared refusal of a node that carries texts. The code rule is the node's own: a W-coded node declares
    text_refusal (key -> a code WORD of that node: node[word]); an L-coded node declares text_codes (key -> a key of
